# Design System

## Palette Tokens

Use semantic tokens, never raw hex/oklch. The design system defines:

| Token | Role | Usage |
|-------|------|-------|
| `primary` | Brand petrol | CTAs, focus rings, active nav |
| `accent` | Warm amber | Secondary actions, highlights, today pill |
| `oneiric` | Deep plum | Dream/mystical surfaces |
| `success` | Sage green | Confirmations |
| `destructive` | Terracotta | Errors, destructive actions |
| `muted` | Neutral | Backgrounds, disabled states |

## Typography Scale

- Headings: `text-2xl sm:text-3xl` (section), `text-xl` (card), `text-base font-medium` (label)
- Body: `text-sm text-slate-400` (secondary), `text-xs text-slate-500` (meta)
- Never use more than 3 font sizes on one screen

## Spacing

- Card padding: `p-4 sm:p-6`
- Section padding: `py-20 px-4`
- Component gaps: `gap-3` (tight), `gap-4` (normal), `gap-6` (loose)

## Component Patterns

- Cards: `rounded-xl bg-slate-800/20 border border-slate-700/30`
- Buttons: min 44x44px touch target, `rounded-lg` or `rounded-xl`
- Inputs: `bg-slate-800/50 border-slate-700 text-white`
- Overlays: use `safe-top safe-x` on fixed/absolute positioned elements

## Animation

- Entrance: `animate-[fade-in-up_0.4s_ease-out]`
- Breathing: `animate-[breathe_4s_ease-in-out_infinite]`
- Hover: `hover:scale-105 transition-transform` or `hover:opacity-90`
- Page transitions: 200ms duration, ease-out timing
- Use CSS animations from globals.css, not JS-driven animation libs

## Anti-Patterns

- Raw color values (`#6366f1`, `bg-indigo-500`) instead of tokens
- Fixed pixel widths on responsive containers
- Missing `min-h-[44px]` on interactive elements
- z-index without purpose (max z-50 for nav, z-40 for overlays)
- `position: fixed` without `safe-top` consideration
